  "task": {
    "objective": "Prepare vegetables and protein, combine one of each on each of three trays, heat full trays, and carry them to the serving counter before spoilage.",
    "natural_termination": "Natural completion at three served orders, or natural exhaustion when no active unspoiled tray remains. Otherwise truncate at tick 180.",
    "interaction": "Every rotation moves every attached item, changing other cooks' reachable ingredients and a full tray's exposure to the single north heater. Shared assembly and floor handoffs compete with carousel timing.",
    "observation_access": "Fully observable public kitchen. Every role receives the same flattened native clock/map, worker inventory and positions, station/slot positions, item existence/kind/holder/attachment/preparation/filling/heat/age/spoilage/last-owner data, and serving/discard/rotation counters. Constant entity activity and visibility masks are declared in state; inactive items are absent in the scene but their fixed-slot history remains public in observations."
